  "text": "| 103\n\nFigure 3.9. Cancer mortality in EU countries by gender, 2021 (or nearest year)\n\nCountry\tTotal\tMen\tWomen\nHungary\t310\t415\t245\nCroatia\t305\t435\t230\nLatvia\t285\t440\t210\nSlovenia\t280\t395\t210\nSlovak Republic\t275\t385\t215\nDenmark\t275\t330\t235\nEstonia\t270\t415\t205\nPoland\t265\t355\t205\nLithuania\t265\t400\t185\nCzechia\t260\t340\t210\nNetherlands\t255\t315\t220\nIreland\t245\t295\t215\nRomania\t245\t340\t180\nGreece\t240\t330\t175\nGermany\t240\t300\t195\nEU27\t235\t315\t180\nBulgaria\t230\t320\t165\nPortugal\t230\t320\t170\nAustria\t225\t290\t185\nFrance\t225\t300\t175\nItaly\t220\t285\t180\nBelgium\t220\t285\t180\nSpain\t215\t300\t155\nCyprus\t215\t275\t175\nFinland\t210\t270\t170\nSweden\t205\t240\t185\nLuxembourg\t205\t275\t160\nMalta\t200\t260\t160\nUnited Kingdom\t260\t315\t220\nNorway\t220\t265\t190\nIceland\t215\t250\t195\nSwitzerland\t195\t245\t160\nTürkiye\t165\t245\t110\n\nNote: The EU average is weighted. Data for the United Kingdom refer to 2020 and have been calculated by the OECD.\n\nSource: Eurostat (hlth_cd_asdr2).\n\nStatLink 2\n\nhttps://stat.link/hufsd5\n\nFigure 3.10. Change in cancer mortality by cancer site in the EU, 2011-21\n\nCancer site\tMortality in 2021 (per 100 000)\tPercentage change 2011-21\tTrend\nPancreas\t18\t5\tIncrease\nBrain\t7\t-6\tDecrease\nSkin\t4\t-8\tDecrease\nLiver\t11\t-11\tDecrease\nProstate\t15\t-9\tDecrease\nBreast\t18\t-10\tDecrease\nLung\t45\t-15\tDecrease\nCervix uteri\t3\t-17\tDecrease\nOvary\t6\t-21\tDecrease\nBladder\t9\t-20\tDecrease\nLeukaemia\t12\t-22\tDecrease\nColorectum\t27\t-21\tDecrease\nStomach\t11\t-34\tDecrease\n\nMortality in 2021 per 100 000 population\n\nNote: The red bubble signals an increase in mortality during 2011-21 while the green bubbles signal a decrease. The size of the bubbles is proportional to the mortality rate in 2021. “Lung” includes cancers of the lung, trachea, and bronchus. “Brain” refers to both brain cancers and central nervous system cancers. The data correspond to the EU27 weighted averages.\n\nSource: Eurostat (hlth_cd_asdr2).\n\nStatLink 2\n\nhttps://stat.link/styxji\n\nHEALTH AT A GLANCE: EUROPE 2024 © OECD/EUROPEAN UNION 2024"
